{"id":"podtverzhdenie","lemma":"подтверждение","pos":"noun","rank":2722,"glosses":["confirmation","corroboration"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/38/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"подтверждения","plural":"подтверждения"},"examples":[{"text":"Какие у вас есть подтверждения?","en":"What proof do you have?","words":[null,{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]},{"text":"Этому не было подтверждения.","en":"That hasn't been confirmed.","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Вы можете привести какое-нибудь доказательство в подтверждение ваших слов?","en":"Can you offer any evidence in support of what you say?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to bring"},null,null,{"g":"evidence"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]},{"text":"Он нашёл подтверждение тому, что пчёлы могут общаться друг с другом.","en":"He found the evidence that bees can communicate with each other.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to find","l":"найти"},null,{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to communicate"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,11,"with one another"]]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, отмените мой заказ и пришлите подтверждение, что это было сделано.","en":"Please cancel my order and send confirmation that this has been done.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to abolish","l":"отменить"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"order"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to send","l":"прислать"},null,null,null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null],"phrases":[[7,9,"why"]]}]}